      centers it. Math: scale = 72/270.85 ≈ 0.266; scaled height ≈ 62.2,
      so translateY = (108 − 62.2) / 2 ≈ 22.9; translateX = (108 − 72) / 2 = 18.

    Color tokens (matching the brand SVG):
      #FB5D53  Coral — pig body, decorative arrows
      #121414  Near-black — accents, mouth, ears
      #D9D9D9  Light grey — alphabet characters + face details
-->
